    "body": "Looks like the is no free macos-14 intel runner.\r\n\r\n<!-- Reviewable:start -->\r\n- - -\r\nThis change is [<img src=\"https://reviewable.io/review_button.svg\" height=\"34\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"Reviewable\"/>](https://reviewable.io/reviews/TokTok/qTox/616)\r\n<!-- Reviewable:end -->\r\n",
    "changed_files": 1,
    "closed_at": "2025-12-12T18:27:43Z",
    "comment_data": [
        {
            "_links": {
                "html": {
                    "href": "https://github.com/TokTok/qTox/pull/616#discussion_r2613517339"
                },
                "pull_request": {
                    "href": "https://api.github.com/repos/TokTok/qTox/pulls/616"
                },
                "self": {
                    "href": "https://api.github.com/repos/TokTok/qTox/pulls/comments/2613517339"
                }
            },
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "macos-13 was the last non-arm64 runner that was freely available, so when doing this, we can remove all the handling of x86_64 macos in CI.\r\n\r\n(Also, what you wrote will always evaluate to 'macos-15' since it's truthy, you probably want a matrix w/ something like `runners: [macos-15, macos-14]` if you want this to run on both those arm64 runners.)",
            "commit_id": "9a0ed93d0e97581e82f9aeb61432a051c54492dc",
            "created_at": "2025-12-12T09:22:09Z",
            "diff_hunk": "@@ -182,7 +182,7 @@ jobs:\n         arch: [arm64, x86_64]\n         exclude:\n           - arch: ${{ github.event_name == 'pull_request' && !contains(github.event.pull_request.labels.*.name, 'packaging') && 'arm64' }}\n-    runs-on: ${{ matrix.arch == 'arm64' && 'macos-14' || 'macos-13' }}\n+    runs-on: ${{ 'macos-15' || 'macos-14' }}",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/TokTok/qTox/pull/616#discussion_r2613517339",
            "id": 2613517339,
            "line": null,
            "node_id": "PRRC_kwDOA9gydM6bxxwb",
